[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2760.15, "timestamp": "00:46:00", "text": "然后，我们再做另一件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2763.51, "timestamp": "00:46:03", "text": "会议。哦，你正在欣赏我的史诗级作品"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2774.23, "timestamp": "00:46:14", "text": "是的，我买了很多来看。我认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2776.15, "timestamp": "00:46:16", "text": "呃，已经过去一段时间了。所以这就是原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2780.47, "timestamp": "00:46:20", "text": "我觉得我的数据全部重置了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2782.23, "timestamp": "00:46:22", "text": "除非你是……，否则它不应该这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2783.99, "timestamp": "00:46:23", "text": "使用新帐户加入。如果是的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2786.55, "timestamp": "00:46:26", "text": "同一个账号，它就一直在那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2788.15, "timestamp": "00:46:28", "text": "但它并不在那里。我玩过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2789.67, "timestamp": "00:46:29", "text": "前。就像我曾经有过一段有毒的经历。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2791.349, "timestamp": "00:46:31", "text": "War Thunder 与许多人都有着密切的关系"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2793.109, "timestamp": "00:46:33", "text": "我们分手过几次，我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2797.19, "timestamp": "00:46:37", "text": "已卸载。我的天啊。就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2798.87, "timestamp": "00:46:38", "text": "过了很久之后，我重新安装了它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2800.71, "timestamp": "00:46:40", "text": "再次。只要账户是同一个账户，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2803.109, "timestamp": "00:46:43", "text": "你的所有历史记录都在那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2805.75, "timestamp": "00:46:45", "text": "H：所以，通常情况下这不是问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2808.95, "timestamp": "00:46:48", "text": "总之，准备一下。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2810.79, "timestamp": "00:46:50", "text": "我应该乘坐哪架飞机？患病的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2813.39, "timestamp": "00:46:53", "text": "准备好就好。任何。无论你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2815.91, "timestamp": "00:46:55", "text": "想。你的选择其实很有限。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2819.19, "timestamp": "00:46:59", "text": "所以我不会限制你。"}]